abstract: "Code and locked data for the preregistered causal battery showing that the observational link between representational dimensionality and OOD transfer (r = +0.97) does not license geometry-as-a-knob interventions: the geometric causal share of the slope is 7.7%, every covariance-spectrum marker is a recipe fingerprint, and the formation-phase forcing battery (96 preregistered runs + five-point dose scan) shows the causal channel carries only ~15% of the observational slope. A preregistered three-seed dose replication does not reproduce the single-seed power-law exponent (b = 0.502 / 0.325 / 0.264) or the low-dose cliff, so the manuscript states only a sub-linear and saturating dose response and reports the failed criteria as limitations; a second preregistered two-seed batch (42-point five-seed archive) confirms the higher low-dose plateau as a cross-seed fact (four of five seeds at 30-38% of observational, maximum 37.5%, still far below the preregistered upper bound). v1.3.0 absorbs the second-stage replication verdict (ADR-0016 App. 28) into the manuscript, ships the 42-point archive and verdict, and extends the self-verification to 87 checks."
